  "sourceTitle": "Raw Beet and Carrot Slaw",
  "sourceText": "Raw Beet and Carrot Slaw\nBy: Shoshanna Levy\nPublished: Wednesday, May 25, 2011 - 5:00pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\nRaw Beet& Carrot Salad\n3 medium beets, peeled\n4 medium carrots, scrubbed\n1 lime, juiced\n1 tablespoon unrefined coconut oil\nhandful cilantro, chopped\n1 teaspoon freshly grated ginger\npinch Himalayan salt\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Shred the beets and carrots in food processor. 2 Place vegetables in a large bowl. 3 Add remaining ingredients, and stir to combine.",
